      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article contains data on the state of the proteolysis system in the systemic blood flow and locally in the duodenal mucosa in those patients with bronchial asthma concurrent with gastroduodenitis. Results of fasting dietetic management versus medicamentous treatments showed a complete normalization of the protease-antiprotease imbalance with food deprivation."},
